<tr style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; page-break-inside: avoid;">
<td style="vertical-align: top;"><div style="text-indent: -1em; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 1em; line-height: normal;"><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;">Fleet operation utilization (7)</div></div></td>
<td style="vertical-align: bottom;">&#160;&#160;</td>
