ont-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;">As of June&#160;30, 2023, diluted earnings per share reflects the potential dilution from conversion of outstanding Series A Preferred Shares calculated with the &#8220;if converted&#8221; method. </div></div> </ix:nonNumeric> <div style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 8pt;">&#160;</div> <div style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:center">F-14 </div> </div> </div> <div style="margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:0em; page-break-before:always"></div> <hr style="color:#999999;height:3px;width:100%;clear:both"/> <div style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 1.67em; margin-bottom: 1.67em;font-weight: bold;"><div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"><a href="#toc">Table of Contents</a></div></div> <div style="text-align:center"> <div style="width:8.5in;text-align:left;margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto"><ix:nonNumeric name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerTextBlock" contextRef="P01_01_2024To06_30_2024" escape="true" id="ixv-7598">
